Let $u$ be a left adjoint to $v$ as in Definition \ref{definition-adjoint}.
\begin{enumerate}
\item If $v \circ u$ is fully faithful, then $u$ is fully faithful.
\item If $u \circ v$ is fully faithful, then $v$ is fully faithful.
\end{enumerate}
